<title>LITHUANIA: MIXED TRADING FOLLOWS TWO DAYS OF GAINS.</title>
<headline>MIXED TRADING FOLLOWS TWO DAYS OF GAINS.</headline>
<text>
<p>*The official index inched up 1.44 points to 921.44.</p>
<p>*Group A shares down 16.18 points to 2,008.74 points.</p>
<p>*Litin G rises 12.04 points to 1,836.30 points.</p>
<p>*Central market turnover 930,000 litas from 870,000 litas</p>
<p>*Alytaus Textile at 0.20 litas from 0.24 litas</p>
</text>
